(Globex Industries - IT Security Standards) Tj T*
(Document GX-SEC-001, revision 5, effective 1 March 2026. Owner: Information Security.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Scope) Tj T*
(These standards apply to every Globex employee, contractor and vendor who uses a Globex) Tj T*
(account, device or network. Exceptions must be approved in writing by the Chief) Tj T*
(Information Security Officer \(CISO\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Passwords and authentication) Tj T*
(Passwords must be at least 14 characters long. Passwords do not expire on a schedule, but) Tj T*
(must be changed immediately if a compromise is suspected. Reusing a password from any) Tj T*
(other service is prohibited. Multi-factor authentication \(MFA\) is mandatory for email, VPN) Tj T*
(and all production systems; hardware security keys are required for administrators.) Tj T*
(Accounts are locked for 15 minutes after 5 failed sign-in attempts.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 30 Td (Page 1 of 3) Tj ET
endstream
