stream
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 14 TL 60 750 Td
(3. Devices) Tj T*
(Only Globex-managed laptops may access internal systems. Full-disk encryption must remain) Tj T*
(enabled at all times. Screens must lock automatically after 5 minutes of inactivity.) Tj T*
(Personal phones may access email only through the approved mobile management app. Lost or) Tj T*
(stolen devices must be reported to the IT Service Desk within 1 hour of discovery.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Data classification) Tj T*
(Globex data has four classes: Public, Internal, Confidential and Restricted. Restricted) Tj T*
(data \(customer personal data, payment data and security keys\) may only be stored in) Tj T*
(approved encrypted systems and must never be sent by email. Confidential data may be) Tj T*
(shared externally only under a signed NDA.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 30 Td (Page 2 of 3) Tj ET
