stream
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 14 TL 60 750 Td
(5. Security incidents) Tj T*
(Suspected security incidents, including phishing emails that were clicked, must be) Tj T*
(reported to security@globex.example or the 24x7 Security Hotline at +1-555-0142 within 30) Tj T*
(minutes. Do not try to investigate an incident yourself. Confirmed incidents involving) Tj T*
(personal data are escalated to the Data Protection Officer within 24 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Software and AI tools) Tj T*
(Only software from the Globex Software Catalog may be installed. Confidential or) Tj T*
(Restricted data must not be entered into public AI tools; the approved internal AI) Tj T*
(assistant may be used for Internal data.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Access reviews) Tj T*
(Managers review their team's access to systems every quarter. Access is removed within 24) Tj T*
(hours of an employee leaving Globex.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 30 Td (Page 3 of 3) Tj ET
